# .NET / Visual Studio
bin/
obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
TestResults/

# VSIX packaging
*.vsix
# NOTE: source.extension.cs (VSIX Synchronizer output, Vsix.* constants from the manifest) is
# intentionally NOT ignored: MSBuild CLI builds do not regenerate it (only the VS designer does),
# so it is committed, like other classic VSSDK projects do.

# Rust / Cargo
target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock
!samples/**/Cargo.lock

# Kubuno.Rust.Sdk's task assembly is a build output (Kubuno.Cargo.MSBuild.Tasks + its
# dependency closure), not source — build it with the command in README.md's "Building Rust
# with MSBuild (.rsproj)" section before using the SDK from a path/local feed.
sdk/Kubuno.Rust.Sdk/tasks/

# Local assistant instructions (not published)
CLAUDE.md
